},"author_id":"1661523610111193088","created_at":"2026-10-14T17:04:57.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110416580899168305"],"id":"2110416580899168305","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":746,"impression_count":354261,"like_count":5331,"quote_count":220,"reply_count":292,"retweet_count":386},"text":"Introducing Grok Voice 3.0, the world’s most intelligent speech-to-speech model.\n\nIt excels at resolving customer calls, responds in under a second, and costs less than other frontier models. https://t.co/cfDRrkQPEc"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110418603850006528"]},"author_id":"1389913567671975937","created_at":"2026-10-14T17:13:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110418612989415821"],"id":"2110418612989415821","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":18029,"like_count":363,"quote_count":6,"reply_count":46,"retweet_count":44},"text":"BREAKING: SpaceXSI just revealed that Starlink uses Grok Voice 3.0 to handle 20,000 daily calls in multiple languages.\n\nAbout 70% need no human &amp; 1 in 4 sales calls ends in a purchase. AI agent verifies customers, troubleshoots hardware, issues credits &amp; ships replacement. https://t.co/htQWdr3hou"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110424954173116416"]},"author_id":"1389913567671975937","created_at":"2026-10-14T17:39:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110425366443790405"],"id":"2110425366443790405","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":14815,"like_count":124,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":26},"text":"BREAKING: SpaceXSI's Grok Voice 3.0 ranks #1 on Artificial Analysis:\n\n• Speech-to-Speech Index: #1 at 86.9 🥇\n• Task Success Rate: #1 at 94.8% 🥇 https://t.co/oQfZL9sgWl"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110427164608954368"]},"author_id":"1389913567671975937","created_at":"2026-10-14T17:48:30.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110427539982438619"],"id":"2110427539982438619","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":14631,"like_count":117,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":33,"retweet_count":20},"text":"BREAKING: Grok Voice 3.0 is the most cost-effective among these models in Artificial Analysis' Big Bench Audio comparison:\n\n• Grok Voice 3.0: $0.025/task\n• GPT-Live-1 (Astra, Medium): $0.030/task\n• GPT-Realtime-2.1 (High): $0.055/task\n\nOver 50% cheaper than GPT-Realtime-2.1 https://t.co/oA5Mc31cjg"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110422562387963904"]},"author_id":"1818311005698678784","created_at":"2026-10-14T17:28:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110422583317524876"],"id":"2110422583317524876","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":13,"impression_count":7011,"like_count":149,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":17,"retweet_count":15},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110416580899168305","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Grok Voice 3.0 is now the world's most intelligent speech-to-speech voice model \n\nIt ranks #1 on Artificial Analysis, responds in under a second, and costs less per task than OpenAI's GPT-Live-1 and GPT-Realtime-2.1 while outperforming everything on the leaderboard\n\nAnd it's https://t.co/WgCkAWuMkK https://t.co/4hYB6HN15X"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110416793852399616","3_2110417096114851840"]},"author_id":"243013409","created_at":"2026-10-14T17:08:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110417482586423759"],"id":"2110417482586423759","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":113,"impression_count":62601,"like_count":1063,"quote_count":9,"reply_count":49,"retweet_count":75},"text":"SpaceX has just introduced Grok Voice 3.0\n\n\"It's the world’s most intelligent speech-to-speech model. It sets a new record for resolving customer support calls, has class-leading latency at under one second, and costs less than other frontier models. It's also cheaper to run than https://t.co/Ll3aFALE3p"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110444295106830336"]},"author_id":"1614879930885574656","created_at":"2026-10-14T18:57:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110444810800681086"],"id":"2110444810800681086","public_metrics":{"bookmark_